    "title": "Pa. senator hosts Youth Holiday Expo in Dauphin County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago STEELTON, Pa. — State Sen. Patty Kim, along with Latino Connection and Geisinger Health Plan, hosted a free Youth Holiday Expo in Dauphin County on Wednesday. The event saw families from across the region gather for an evening of holiday festivities and fun at I.W. Abel Banquet Hall in Steelton. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
